  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E9hENAd.png\" alt=\"banner1\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsdob\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sdob\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgamejolt.com%252fgames%252fsdob%252f953274\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/h85Hg1b.png\" alt=\"GameJolt\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fd4vide106.itch.io%252fsdob-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qz2uWJJ.png\" alt=\"Itch.io\"></a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <strong>🗼 巴別螺旋迷宮 🗼</strong><br>\n  靈感來自《輕小說》系列，此MOD帶來一座高度超過300格、共30層挑戰的完全原版風格塔樓結構。難得遇見且蘊含史詩冒險，是所有最強勇者的勇氣考驗！\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/8fnO7HA9wRY\" width=\"600\" height=\"340\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <h3>🌟 巴別螺旋迷宮的第一層 🔥</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>🟤 <strong>第1層：赫菲斯托斯的熔爐</strong> – 工匠之神的家園，充滿工具與秘密。</li>\n    <li>🌌 <strong>第2層：尼克斯領域</strong> – 被黑暗籠罩，陰影在此甦醒。</li>\n    <li>🌿 <strong>第3層：得墨忒爾的花園</strong> – 繁榮的避風港，受自然之怒守護。</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <strong>📢 有反饋或發現錯誤？</strong><br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/thfPJ7QAPJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_46h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:right\">\n  <strong>💖 支援捐款！</strong><br>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/checkout/InfinityWonderful?rid=0&cadence=1&custom=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a><br>\n  <em>你的支援協助我改良並更新此MOD。謝謝！</em>\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <strong>🔧 相容模組載入器</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_46h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_46h.png\" alt=\"Forge\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/neoforge_46h.png\" alt=\"Neoforge\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/quilt_46h.png\" alt=\"Quilt\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/spiral-dungeon-of-babel-sdob-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1G0f1rR.png\" alt=\"Datapack\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <strong>🌟 在整合包中的使用方式</strong><br>\n  歡迎將<strong>巴別螺旋迷宮</strong>加入整合包或分享，請務必標註D4vide106並連結至官方來源（如Modrinth、CurseForge等）。\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9AdFsCE.png\" alt=\"Creator\"> 由 D4vide106 製作</strong><br>\n  <em>我的第二個作品——感謝您的支持！</em>\n</div>\n<hr>",
